Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `values[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `right`
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/returned_mutable_view_conflicts_with_overlapping_view.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     right: values[0..1].in_place()
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
